    "intro_html":  "Carbonada is the Chilean answer to a cold week: beef and every vegetable in the drawer, simmered together until the pot goes thick. Traditionally it leans on zapallo squash, and sweet potato plays that role here. Rice cooks right in and turns a soup into dinner. Each bowl carries \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and {{cal}} calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
